  "playground.virtualTryOn.bottomTip": "AI change clothes: upload one full-body front-facing model image and one flat-lay clothing image, pick the clothes type (Upper-body / Lower-body / Dress), and the garment is \"put on\" the model to generate the result. Both images must be publicly reachable, 512–3000px per side. No prompt needed. After submitting, the backend polls; if you leave and return, the last task is restored locally and polling continues.",
