  "playground.virtualman.metaS2vLabel": "Wan S2V · Image + Audio → Speak/Sing",
  "playground.virtualman.metaS2vDesc": "One portrait image + an audio clip → a speaking/singing/performance video. Supports full body / half body / portrait, 480P/720P",
  "playground.virtualman.metaEmoLabel": "Wan EMO Live Portrait · Image + Audio",
  "playground.virtualman.metaEmoDesc": "Portrait + audio (≤60s) → live portrait. ratio selects 1:1 (512×512) or 3:4 (512×704); emo-detect runs automatically before submission to get the face box",
  "playground.virtualman.metaLiveportraitLabel": "Wan LivePortrait · Long Audio",
  "playground.virtualman.metaLiveportraitDesc": "Portrait + long audio (<3min) → live portrait lip-sync with eye / mouth / head motion control; liveportrait-detect gate runs automatically before submission",
  "playground.virtualman.metaVideoretalkLabel": "Wan VideoRetalk Lip Replace · Video + Audio",
  "playground.virtualman.metaVideoretalkDesc": "A real-person video (2~120s) + new audio → a new video with aligned lip movements. For multi-person video, optionally use ref_image to pick the face to re-lip",
  "playground.virtualman.metaAnimateMoveLabel": "Wan Animate Motion Transfer · Image + Driving Video",
  "playground.virtualman.metaAnimateMoveDesc": "Portrait image + driving video (2~30s) → make the person in the image perform the motions in the video. mode: wan-std (fast) or wan-pro (quality)",
  "playground.virtualman.metaAnimateMixLabel": "Wan Animate Person Swap · Image + Video",
  "playground.virtualman.metaAnimateMixDesc": "Replace the person in a video with a portrait image, keeping the original motion / expression / environment. mode: wan-std or wan-pro",
  "playground.virtualman.metaEmojiLabel": "Wan Emoji Animated Expression · Image + Template",
  "playground.virtualman.metaEmojiDesc": "Front-facing portrait + preset expression template (driven_id) → an animated expression video; emoji-detect runs automatically before submission to get the face box",
  "playground.virtualman.metaOmnihumanLabel": "Jimeng OmniHuman1.5 · Image + Audio → Video",
  "playground.virtualman.metaOmnihumanDesc": "Provide a portrait image + an audio clip (<60s, ≤15s recommended) → an avatar video with lip-sync + full-body motion. No avatar rental needed — just configure Volcano AK/SK. Optional prompt (≤300 chars) / 720P or 1080P",
  "playground.virtualman.metaDreamActorLabel": "Jimeng Motion Mimic DreamActor-M1 · Image + Template Video",
  "playground.virtualman.metaDreamActorDesc": "A character image + a template video → make the person in the image move with the template's motion / expression / lip movements, keeping the subject and background consistent. No audio needed. Pass duration = template video seconds for accurate billing",
  "playground.virtualman.metaKlingV3Label": "Kling V3.0 Motion Control · Image + Reference Video",
  "playground.virtualman.metaKlingV3Desc": "Character image + reference motion video (3~30s) → make the person in the image perform the motions in the video, with better consistency. mode std (720p) / pro (1080p); can keep the original audio and choose framing orientation",
  "playground.virtualman.metaKlingV26Label": "Kling V2.6 Motion Control · Image + Reference Video",
  "playground.virtualman.metaKlingV26Desc": "Character image + reference motion video (3~30s) → motion transfer. mode std (720p) / pro (1080p); can keep the original audio and choose framing orientation",
  "playground.virtualman.metaLipsyncVideoLabel": "Video Lip-Sync · lipsync-video (Tencent)",
  "playground.virtualman.metaLipsyncVideoDesc": "Provide a real-person video + text (SSML) or audio → a new video with aligned lip movements. SSML ≤2000 chars / audio ≤20min",
  "playground.virtualman.metaLipsyncPhotoLabel": "Photo Lip-Sync · lipsync-photo (Tencent)",
  "playground.virtualman.metaLipsyncPhotoDesc": "Provide a real-person photo + text or audio → an avatar video. SSML ≤300 chars / audio ≤60s / 720P or 1080P",
  "playground.virtualman.metaBroadcastLabel": "Avatar Broadcast · broadcast (Tencent, rental required)",
  "playground.virtualman.metaBroadcastDesc": "Specify a pretrained VirtualmanKey avatar + text/audio/voice conversion → a broadcast video. SSML ≤20000 chars / supports transparent background output",
